<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Louis III, Grand Duke of Hesse</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1806–1877</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Louis III was grand duke of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hesse">Hesse</a> from 1848 to 1877, succeeding his father Louis II during the revolution. His reign saw the conservative government of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/reinhard-von-dalwigk">Reinhard von Dalwigk</a>, defeat as <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a>'s ally in 1866 and entry into the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/german-empire">German Empire</a> in 1871. He had no children, and was succeeded by his nephew Louis IV.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/louis-iii-grand-duke-of-hesse.jpg" alt="Louis III, Grand Duke of Hesse" width="320" height="485" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: unknow person · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Gro%C3%9Fherzog_Ludwig_III_von_Hessen_in_%C3%B6sterreichischer_Uniform.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
